{
  "file_id": "3599",
  "text_count": 52,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������Haaaah! Thank you for coming!",
      "_offset": 2330,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "No problem! So what happened?",
      "_offset": 2368,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "My fur's gotten all dry and rough\nlately!",
      "_offset": 2398,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Really? I think it's pretty shiny\nnow, but...",
      "_offset": 2440,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "We Mojyamon use a special medicine\nto make it shiny!",
      "_offset": 2486,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Huh? Using treatment on your fur?\nThat's so fashionable!",
      "_offset": 2539,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "So what should we do?",
      "_offset": 2596,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "I traveled around here a lot when\nI was looking for T.K, so I'm\nup for helping you out!",
      "_offset": 2618,
      "_length": 90,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "I'll help, too!",
      "_offset": 2709,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Thank you, Matt! I'm counting on\nyou, guys!",
      "_offset": 2725,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Hey, guys, do you have ingredients\nfor the medicine?",
      "_offset": 2771,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Nope! This isn't enough at all!",
      "_offset": 2824,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "That's weird, I feel like there\nwas more last time I was here...",
      "_offset": 2856,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "There's evidence of someone\nwalking around here. Maybe they\ngrabbed it first.",
      "_offset": 2921,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "So they took everything? They\nshould have at least left a little\nfor us!",
      "_offset": 2999,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "If we follow the trail, maybe\nwe'll catch up to them.",
      "_offset": 3072,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Yeah, maybe we can talk it out and\nconvince them to share with us.",
      "_offset": 3126,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Let's go, Matt!",
      "_offset": 3193,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 3211,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "There are Digimon in the back!",
      "_offset": 3217,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "There's something weird about\nthese Digimon!",
      "_offset": 3248,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Don't tell me they've eaten the\ningredients?!",
      "_offset": 3293,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "The ingredients have side effects\nthat could have made them\naggressive!",
      "_offset": 3339,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "That was a real ride.",
      "_offset": 3411,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "If we wait a little while, they\nshould return to normal.",
      "_offset": 3433,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Gah! What's going on here?",
      "_offset": 3490,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Seems like the medicinal\ningredients drove them mad.",
      "_offset": 3517,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Hm, looks like there's more than\nenough left. I'll take care of\n'em.",
      "_offset": 3570,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "That said, I wonder why they were\nalso collecting ingredients...",
      "_offset": 3639,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "I bet they wanted to have shiny\nfur like Mojyamon!",
      "_offset": 3704,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "That must be it!",
      "_offset": 3755,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Thanks for taking care of this!\nHere's my thank-you gift!",
      "_offset": 3772,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Thanks, Mojyamon!",
      "_offset": 3830,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Tell us when you become a shiny\nMojyamon! We'll come and visit\nyou!",
      "_offset": 3848,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Hah! Looking forward to it!",
      "_offset": 3916,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "There should be some ingredients\nin this area. Let's look for them.",
      "_offset": 3944,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Obtained medicine ingredients!",
      "_offset": 4012,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "This looks like it'll taste\ndisgusting. Are you sure these are\nmedicinal ingredients?",
      "_offset": 4043,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "It's probably some kind of topical\ncream.",
      "_offset": 4129,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "This can't possibly be enough.\nLet's look elsewhere.",
      "_offset": 4171,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Obtained medicine ingredients!",
      "_offset": 4224,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Considering how big Mojyamon is,\nwe need to get a lot more than\nthis.",
      "_offset": 4255,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "_offset": 4325,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Obtained medicine ingredients!",
      "_offset": 4333,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Let's enter the cave!",
      "_offset": 4364,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Get more information first.",
      "_offset": 4386,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "The back's pitch dark.",
      "_offset": 4414,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "We shouldn't just charge in there.",
      "_offset": 4437,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "You're right.",
      "_offset": 4472,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Mojyamon said he needs three types\nof ingredients to make the\nmedicine.",
      "_offset": 4486,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "There should be some ingredients\nin this area. Let's look for them.",
      "_offset": 4558,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 4626,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}